        <mxCell id="9B0E8JW4gbZllgAhEfek-2" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Damso,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: &amp;quot;Inter Variable&amp;quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;de son vrai nom William Kalubi Mwamba&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;est un rappeur, auteur et compositeur belgo-congolais né le 10 mai 1992 à Kinshasa. Il grandit à Bruxelles après avoir quitté le Congo avec sa famille. Il se fait connaître en 2015 grâce à Booba, qui le fait signer sur son label 92i. Son premier album&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot; data-start=&quot;430&quot;&gt;Batterie Faible&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(2016) reçoit un grand succès, suivi de&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;497&quot; data-start=&quot;488&quot;&gt;Ipséité&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(2017),&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;519&quot; data-start=&quot;506&quot;&gt;Lithopédion&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;(2018) et&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot; data-start=&quot;530&quot;&gt;QALF&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(2020), tous salués pour leur écriture soignée et leur style à la fois sombre et introspectif.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="tkyopFA9pMMFncS7VcC6-4">
